@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Camfranglais — public use cases, not account administration
left to right direction
actor "Public visitor" as Visitor
actor "Server operator\n(outside public UI)" as Operator
rectangle "Public compiler workspace" {
  usecase "Open public session\n(no registration or login)" as Open
  usecase "Analyze text and retain\nan immutable public test" as Analyze
  usecase "Inspect saved tests,\ntoken statistics and CFG traces" as Inspect
  usecase "Browse/search\nread-only Collection" as Collection
  usecase "Search source-labelled\nDictionary" as Dictionary
  usecase "Browse clearly labelled\nSynthetic examples" as Examples
  usecase "Copy chosen text unchanged\nto Franc Analyzer" as Copy
  usecase "Look up an existing\nrecorded reading" as Lookup
  usecase "Play/download\nexisting audio" as Play
  usecase "Read privacy and\nprovenance limitations" as Privacy
}
rectangle "Private operational procedures\nnot public HTTP use cases" #FFF6E8 {
  usecase "Configure HTTPS and\nservice deployment" as Deploy
  usecase "Maintain/recover protected\nshared data and archives" as Recover
  usecase "Review/curate source data\noffline with change control" as Curate
}
Visitor --> Open
Visitor --> Analyze
Visitor --> Inspect
Visitor --> Collection
Visitor --> Dictionary
Visitor --> Examples
Visitor --> Copy
Visitor --> Lookup
Visitor --> Play
Visitor --> Privacy
Analyze ..> Open : <<include>>\nrequest protection ready
Copy ..> Collection : <<extend>>\nchosen entry
Copy ..> Dictionary : <<extend>>\nchosen reference
Copy ..> Examples : <<extend>>\nchosen example
Play ..> Lookup : <<extend>>\nmatching reading exists
Operator --> Deploy
Operator --> Recover
Operator --> Curate
note bottom of Analyze
  Analyze in the current UI records a test.
  A test does not add an entry to Collection.
  UNKNOWN-only vocabulary approval and
  CFG acceptance are separate results.
end note
legend bottom
  Read-only means protected reference resources; public test append is deliberately allowed.
  No account controls, account counter, Collection/grammar/audio mutation or coursework export UI.
  Recorded voice is playback, not browser synthesis, dictation or cloning.
endlegend
@enduml
